      "explanation": "The family repeatedly had missing or partial reports and uncertain follow-up. The doctor built and refined a stepwise navigation plan: get/ask for culture, MRI, vascular, medication, wound/negative-pressure and discharge paperwork; preserve emergency thresholds; use hospital/clinic routes and fallback to urgent care; and obtain caregiver receipt.",
